NXINFO.b6=nxE("🧠",["Dimaag aur mood ka vitamin","The brain and mood vitamin"],["Vitamin B6 paani me ghulne wala vitamin hai. Yeh body ko protein use karne me madad karta hai.","Vitamin B6 is water-soluble. It helps the body use protein."],
["Dimaag aur nervein theek rakhta hai|Haemoglobin banane me madad|Mood wale serotonin ko banata hai|Protein aur sugar ka use karwata hai","Keeps brain and nerves healthy|Helps make haemoglobin|Helps make mood chemical serotonin|Helps use protein and sugar"],
["Chidchidapan aur udaasi|Muh ke kone fatna, jeebh me jalan|Hath-pair me jhunjhuni|Anaemia (khoon ki kami)","Irritability and low mood|Cracked mouth corners, sore tongue|Tingling in hands and feet|Anaemia"],
["Supplement se zyada (100 mg/din se upar) nerves ko nuksan, hath-pair sunn ho sakte hain|Khane se zyada hone ka dar nahi","High supplement doses (over 100 mg/day) can damage nerves and cause numbness|Food alone will not cause excess"],
["Kela, chana, aloo, murgi aur machhli achhe source hain. Khane ko zyada ubalo mat, B6 paani me chala jaata hai.","Banana, chickpeas, potato, chicken and fish are good sources. Do not over-boil; B6 leaks into water."],
{m:1.3,f:1.3,u:"mg",by:"NIH"},[NXN("Vitamin B6","VitaminB6"),NXS[0]]);
NXINFO.magnesium=nxE("🌰",["Muscles aur neend ka mineral","The muscle and sleep mineral"],["Magnesium body ke 300 se zyada kaamon me lagta hai, jaise energy banana, muscles aur nerves.","Magnesium is used in 300+ body processes, such as energy, muscles and nerves."],
["Muscles ko relax karta hai|Dil ki dhadkan aur BP theek rakhta hai|Haddi majboot karta hai|Sugar control me madad","Relaxes muscles|Supports heartbeat and BP|Strengthens bones|Helps blood sugar control"],
["Muscle cramp, palak phadakna|Thakan aur kamzori|Dhadkan gadbad hona|Bechaini aur neend me dikkat","Muscle cramps, eyelid twitching|Tiredness and weakness|Irregular heartbeat|Restlessness and poor sleep"],
["Supplement se dast aur pet dard (supplement limit 350 mg/din)|Khane wale magnesium se aam taur par dikkat nahi|Kidney problem me doctor se poochho","Supplements cause diarrhoea and cramps (supplement limit 350 mg/day)|Food magnesium rarely causes problems|Ask a doctor if you have kidney problems"],
["Badam, kaju, saabut anaaj, palak aur daal lo. Zyada pakaane aur chhaanne se magnesium kam ho jaata hai.","Have almonds, cashews, whole grains, spinach and dal. Heavy cooking and refining remove magnesium."],
{m:440,f:370,u:"mg"},[NXN("Magnesium","Magnesium"),NXS[0]]);
NXINFO.folate=nxE("🍃",["Naye cells banane wala vitamin","The new-cell vitamin"],["Folate (Vitamin B9) cells aur DNA banane ke liye zaroori hai. Iska supplement wala roop folic acid kehlata hai.","Folate (vitamin B9) is needed to make cells and DNA. Its supplement form is called folic acid."],
["Naye cells aur DNA banata hai|Pregnancy me baby ke dimaag aur spine ke liye zaroori|Khoon banane me madad|Homocysteine kam karne me madad","Makes new cells and DNA|Vital in pregnancy for baby's brain and spine|Helps make blood|Helps lower homocysteine"],
["Anaemia aur thakan|Muh ke chhale, jeebh me jalan|Pregnancy me baby me neural tube defect ka risk|Chidchidapan","Anaemia and tiredness|Mouth ulcers, sore tongue|Neural tube defect risk in pregnancy|Irritability"],
["Zyada folic acid B12 ki kami chhupa sakta hai|Supplement limit: 1000 µg/din|Pregnancy me doctor ki salah se hi lo","Too much folic acid can hide B12 deficiency|Supplement limit: 1000 µg/day|In pregnancy, take only on doctor's advice"],
["Hari patte wali sabziyan, daal, chana aur santra lo. Lambi pakaai se folate kam hota hai, halka pakao. Pregnancy plan ho to doctor se folic acid poochho.","Have leafy greens, dal, chickpeas and oranges. Long cooking destroys folate, so cook lightly. If planning pregnancy, ask a doctor about folic acid."],
{m:300,f:220,u:"µg"},[NXN("Folate","Folate"),NXS[0]]);
NXINFO.vitk=nxE("🥬",["Khoon jamane wala vitamin","The blood-clotting vitamin"],["Vitamin K khoon jamane aur haddi ke liye zaroori hai. Yeh fat me ghulta hai.","Vitamin K is needed for blood clotting and bones. It dissolves in fat."],
["Chot lagne par khoon jamata hai|Haddi majboot karta hai|Calcium ko sahi jagah pahunchata hai|Nasein theek rakhta hai","Clots blood after injury|Strengthens bones|Directs calcium to the right place|Keeps blood vessels healthy"],
["Chot par der tak khoon behna|Naak se khoon, aasani se neel padna|Haddi kamzor hona|Newborn bachon me kami khatarnak, doctor injection dete hain","Bleeding for long after injury|Nosebleeds, easy bruising|Weak bones|Dangerous in newborns, so doctors give an injection"],
["Khane se zyada hone ka dar kam hai|Blood thinner (warfarin) lete ho to hari sabziyan achanak zyada ya kam na karo, doctor se poochho","Little risk of excess from food|If you take a blood thinner (warfarin), do not suddenly change greens intake; ask your doctor"],
["Palak, methi, sarson ka saag aur broccoli me bahut milta hai. Thode tel ke saath khao, tab zyada absorb hota hai.","Rich in spinach, fenugreek, mustard greens and broccoli. Eat with a little oil for better absorption."],
{m:120,f:90,u:"µg",by:"NIH"},[NXN("Vitamin K","VitaminK"),NXS[0]]);
NXINFO.vita=nxE("🥕",["Aankhon aur skin ka vitamin","The eye and skin vitamin"],["Vitamin A aankhon, skin aur immunity ke liye zaroori hai. Gajar me beta-carotene hota hai, jise body Vitamin A me badal leti hai.","Vitamin A is needed for eyes, skin and immunity. Carrots have beta-carotene, which the body turns into vitamin A."],
["Raat me dekhne me madad|Skin aur andar ki parat theek rakhta hai|Immunity badhata hai|Bachon ki growth me kaam aata hai","Helps night vision|Keeps skin and linings healthy|Boosts immunity|Supports children's growth"],
["Raat ko kam dikhna (night blindness)|Aankhein sukhi|Baar baar infection|Bachon me aankhon ki gambhir bimari","Poor night vision (night blindness)|Dry eyes|Frequent infections|Serious eye disease in children"],
["Supplement ya jaanwar ke jigar se zyada Vitamin A nuksan karta hai: sir dard, ulti, haddi kamzor|Upper limit: 3000 µg/din|Pregnancy me zyada Vitamin A baby ke liye khatarnak ho sakta hai","Too much from supplements or liver harms: headache, vomiting, weak bones|Upper limit: 3000 µg/day|Excess in pregnancy can harm the baby"],
["Gajar, papita, shakarkand, palak aur aam lo. Thode tel ke saath pakao, absorption badhta hai.","Have carrot, papaya, sweet potato, spinach and mango. Cook with a little oil to absorb more."],
{m:1000,f:840,u:"µg"},[NXN("Vitamin A","VitaminA"),NXS[0]]);
NXINFO.b12=nxE("🥚",["Nerves aur khoon ka vitamin","The nerve and blood vitamin"],["Vitamin B12 nervein aur khoon banane ke liye zaroori hai. Yeh mukhya roop se dudh, anda, maas aur machhli me milta hai.","Vitamin B12 is needed for nerves and blood. It is found mainly in milk, eggs, meat and fish."],
["Laal khoon ke cells banata hai|Nervein aur dimaag theek rakhta hai|DNA banata hai|Thakan door karta hai","Makes red blood cells|Keeps nerves and brain healthy|Makes DNA|Fights tiredness"],
["Thakan, kamzori, anaemia|Hath-pair me jhunjhuni|Yaaddasht kamzor, udaasi|Jeebh laal aur chhale","Tiredness, weakness, anaemia|Tingling in hands and feet|Poor memory, low mood|Red sore tongue"],
["Khane ya supplement se aam taur par nuksan nahi dekha gaya (upper limit set nahi)|Phir bhi supplement doctor ki salah se lo","No harm usually seen from food or supplements (no upper limit set)|Still take supplements on a doctor's advice"],
["Shakahari logon me kami ka risk zyada hai: dudh, dahi, paneer aur fortified foods lo. Zaroorat ho to test karwakar doctor se supplement lo.","Vegetarians have a higher risk: have milk, curd, paneer and fortified foods. If needed, test and take a supplement on a doctor's advice."],
{m:2.2,f:2.2,u:"µg"},[NXN("Vitamin B12","VitaminB12"),NXS[0]]);
NXINFO.vitd=nxE("☀️",["Dhoop wala vitamin","The sunshine vitamin"],["Body Vitamin D tab banati hai jab skin par dhoop padti hai. Yeh calcium absorb karne me madad karta hai.","The body makes vitamin D when sunlight falls on skin. It helps absorb calcium."],
["Calcium aur phosphorus absorb karwata hai|Haddi aur daant majboot karta hai|Immunity aur muscles ke liye|Mood me madad","Helps absorb calcium and phosphorus|Strengthens bones and teeth|Supports immunity and muscles|Helps mood"],
["Haddi aur kamar me dard|Muscle kamzori|Bachon me rickets|Adults me osteomalacia (haddi naram hona)","Bone and back pain|Muscle weakness|Rickets in children|Osteomalacia (soft bones) in adults"],
["Zyada supplement se calcium badhta hai: ulti, kamzori, kidney problem|Upper limit: 100 µg (4000 IU)/din|Dhoop se zyada hone ka dar nahi","Excess supplements raise calcium: vomiting, weakness, kidney problems|Upper limit: 100 µg (4000 IU)/day|Sunlight cannot cause excess"],
["Roz kuch der chehre aur hathon par dhoop lo. Khane me anda ki zardi, machhli aur fortified dudh lo.","Get some daily sunlight on face and arms. Eat egg yolk, fish and fortified milk."],
{m:15,f:15,u:"µg"},[NXN("Vitamin D","VitaminD"),NXS[0]]);
NXINFO.selenium=nxE("✨",["Cells ki suraksha ka mineral","The cell-protection mineral"],["Selenium ek trace mineral hai (bahut kam chahiye). Yeh antioxidant ki tarah kaam karta hai aur thyroid ke liye zaroori hai.","Selenium is a trace mineral (needed in tiny amounts). It acts as an antioxidant and supports the thyroid."],
["Cells ko nuksan se bachata hai|Thyroid hormone banane me madad|Immunity badhata hai|DNA banane me madad","Protects cells from damage|Helps make thyroid hormone|Boosts immunity|Helps make DNA"],
["Kamzori aur thakan|Thyroid ki dikkat|Baal jhadna|Kami kam hoti hai, par jahan mitti me selenium kam ho wahan ho sakti hai","Weakness and tiredness|Thyroid problems|Hair loss|Rare, but can happen where soil has little selenium"],
["Zyada selenium (400 µg/din se upar) se baal-nakhun jhadna aur pet kharab|Brazil nut me bahut zyada hota hai|Supplement bina doctor ke na lo","Too much (over 400 µg/day) causes hair and nail loss and stomach upset|Brazil nuts contain a lot|Do not take supplements without a doctor"],
["Anda, machhli, saabut anaaj aur sunflower seeds se milta hai. Aam taur par khane se hi poora ho jaata hai.","Found in eggs, fish, whole grains and sunflower seeds. Food usually covers the need."],
{m:55,f:55,u:"µg",by:"NIH"},[NXN("Selenium","Selenium"),NXS[0]]);
NXINFO.vite=nxE("🌻",["Skin aur antioxidant vitamin","The skin and antioxidant vitamin"],["Vitamin E fat me ghulne wala antioxidant hai. Yeh cells ko nuksan se bachata hai.","Vitamin E is a fat-soluble antioxidant. It protects cells from damage."],
["Cells ko free radicals se bachata hai|Skin aur aankhon ke liye achha|Immunity me madad|Nasein theek rakhta hai","Protects cells from free radicals|Good for skin and eyes|Supports immunity|Keeps blood vessels healthy"],
["Muscles kamzor|Hath-pair me sunnpan|Aankhon ki dikkat|Kami kam hoti hai, fat kam absorb hone par ho sakti hai","Weak muscles|Numbness in hands and feet|Eye problems|Rare; can occur if fat is poorly absorbed"],
["Zyada supplement se khoon patla hota hai, chot par zyada khoon behta hai|Upper limit: 1000 mg/din (supplement)|Blood thinner lete ho to doctor se poochho","High supplements thin the blood and cause bleeding|Upper limit: 1000 mg/day (supplements)|Ask a doctor if you take blood thinners"],
["Badam, sunflower seeds, mungfali aur tel (sunflower, sarson) me milta hai. Roz thode mewe khao.","Found in almonds, sunflower seeds, peanuts and oils (sunflower, mustard). Eat a few nuts daily."],
{m:15,f:15,u:"mg",by:"NIH"},[NXN("Vitamin E","VitaminE"),NXS[0]]);
NXINFO.ribo=nxE("🥛",["Energy banane wala vitamin","The energy-making vitamin"],["Vitamin B2 (riboflavin) khana ko energy me badalne me madad karta hai. Dudh, dahi aur anda me milta hai.","Vitamin B2 (riboflavin) helps turn food into energy. Found in milk, curd and eggs."],
["Energy banane me madad|Skin, aankhein aur muh ke liye zaroori|Doosre B vitamins ko kaam me lata hai|Cells ki growth me madad","Helps make energy|Needed for skin, eyes and mouth|Helps other B vitamins work|Supports cell growth"],
["Muh ke kone aur hont fatna|Jeebh laal aur sujhi|Aankhein laal, jalan|Skin par daane aur thakan","Cracked lips and mouth corners|Red swollen tongue|Red, burning eyes|Skin rashes and tiredness"],
["Zyada hone par nuksan nahi dekha gaya; body extra peshaab se nikal deti hai (peshaab peela ho jaata hai)|Khane se dikkat nahi","No harm seen from excess; extra leaves in urine (urine turns bright yellow)|Food causes no problem"],
["Dudh ko seedhi dhoop me na rakho, roshni se B2 kam hota hai. Dudh, dahi, anda aur hari sabziyan lo.","Do not keep milk in direct light; light destroys B2. Have milk, curd, eggs and green vegetables."],
{m:1.3,f:1.1,u:"mg",by:"NIH"},[NXN("Riboflavin","Riboflavin"),NXS[0]]);
NXINFO.phos=nxE("🦷",["Haddi aur daant ka saathi mineral","The bone and teeth partner mineral"],["Phosphorus haddi aur daant ka bada hissa banata hai. Yeh calcium ke saath milke kaam karta hai.","Phosphorus forms a big part of bones and teeth. It works together with calcium."],
["Haddi aur daant banata hai|Energy (ATP) banata hai|Cells aur DNA ka hissa hai|Kidney aur muscles ke kaam me madad","Builds bones and teeth|Makes energy (ATP)|Part of cells and DNA|Helps kidneys and muscles work"],
["Haddi kamzor aur dard|Bhookh kam, thakan|Muscle kamzori|Kami bahut kam hoti hai","Weak, painful bones|Low appetite, tiredness|Muscle weakness|Deficiency is rare"],
["Zyada phosphorus (khaaskar cold drink aur processed food se) calcium ka balance bigadta hai|Kidney ke mareezon ko limit karni padti hai, doctor se poochho|Upper limit: 4000 mg/din","Too much (especially from colas and processed food) upsets calcium balance|People with kidney disease must limit it; ask a doctor|Upper limit: 4000 mg/day"],
["Dudh, daal, kaju-badam aur saabut anaaj me milta hai. Cold drink aur packet wale processed food kam karo.","Found in milk, dal, nuts and whole grains. Cut down colas and packaged processed food."],
{m:700,f:700,u:"mg",by:"NIH"},[NXN("Phosphorus","Phosphorus"),NXS[0]]);
NXINFO.water=nxE("💧",["Zindagi ka sabse zaroori nutrient","The most essential nutrient"],["Body ka lagbhag 60% hissa paani hai. Paani ke bina body kuch din hi chal sakti hai.","About 60% of the body is water. Without water the body can last only a few days."],
["Body ka temperature theek rakhta hai|Khana hazam karne aur nutrients pahunchane me madad|Peshaab aur paseene se kachra nikalta hai|Joints, skin aur dimaag ke liye zaroori","Keeps body temperature steady|Helps digest food and carry nutrients|Removes waste through urine and sweat|Needed for joints, skin and brain"],
["Pyaas, sir dard, chakkar|Peshaab gehra peela aur kam aana|Munh sukha aur thakan|Kabz aur kidney stone ka risk","Thirst, headache, dizziness|Dark yellow, low urine|Dry mouth and tiredness|Constipation and kidney stone risk"],
["Ek saath bahut zyada paani peene se sodium kam ho sakta hai (bahut rare)|Dil ya kidney ke mareez doctor ke hisaab se paani lein","Drinking a huge amount at once can lower sodium (very rare)|People with heart or kidney disease should follow doctor's advice"],
["Din bhar thoda thoda piyo aur peshaab halka peela rakho. Garmi, kasrat ya bukhar me zyada piyo. Tarbooz, kheera aur dahi bhi paani dete hain.","Sip through the day and keep urine pale yellow. Drink more in heat, exercise or fever. Watermelon, cucumber and curd also give water."],
{m:3.7,f:2.7,u:"L",by:"NASEM"},[["NASEM: DRI for Water, Potassium, Sodium","https://nap.nationalacademies.org/catalog/10925"],NXS[0]],["Yeh poora paani hai (peene wala + khane se). Peene wala paani lagbhag 80% hota hai.","This is total water (drinks plus food). Drinks supply about 80%."]);
